Postings preserve transaction source locations from included files.

========== API ==========

postings()

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
account Assets:Cash
account Expenses:Food
include included.ledger

2024-01-02 Lunch
  Assets:Cash  -20 SEK
  Expenses:Food

========== FILE included.ledger ==========

; Imported transactions

2024-01-01 Breakfast
  Assets:Cash  -10 SEK
  Expenses:Food

